{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemessosh"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Sosh theme is the theme dedicated to the Sosh brand only."}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"Theme Sosh"}],"externalID":"OUDSThemesSosh","symbolKind":"module","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_sosh.png"}],"title":"Theme Sosh","modules":[{"name":"Theme Sosh"}],"role":"collection","roleHeading":"Library"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["🧬 Theme version: 2.9.0"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the Sosh theme any Sosh product must use, and cannot be subclassed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It embeds also in its target the Sosh brand colors which are not shared nor exposed in lower level targets or outside any module not depending to it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In other words, this "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshTheme","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is based on the abstract "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":", uses all the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange Unified Design System"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" kit and brings the Sosh brand colors and assets."}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This theme embeds and registers the fonts for the Sosh theme, you just need to use the theme object as is."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"tip","name":"Tip"},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Sosh theme does not embed colors for charts yet and is read only: it cannot be subclassed or derivated"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"important","name":"Important"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"How to use the theme","anchor":"How-to-use-the-theme"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshTheme","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" directly. To use the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshTheme","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" without further modifications, you will have to use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":" for your root view and give it an instance of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshTheme","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Keep in mind the themes are "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift class objects"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" and can be heavy, so you may use only as instance as singleton and not store any properties."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["@main","struct YourApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            OUDSThemeableView(theme: SoshTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","            }","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then, in your views, you can simply use the theme through an environment variable to get the tokens:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct SomeView: View {","","    \/\/ Get OUDS environment variable for theme thanks to themeable view","    @Environment(\\.theme) var theme","    ","    var body: some View {","        ","        \/\/ Use the theme to retrieve the tokens","        \/\/ For spaces: theme.spaces","        \/\/ For sizes: theme.sizes","        \/\/ For borders: theme.borders","        \/\/ For elevations: theme.elevations","        \/\/ For opacities: theme.opacities","        \/\/ For colors: theme.colors","        \/\/ For button configuration: theme.button","        \/\/ For link configuration: theme.link","        \/\/ Etc.","    }","}"]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"How to tune the theme","anchor":"How-to-tune-the-theme"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You cannot tune the Sosh theme."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Typography","anchor":"Typography"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Sosh theme uses its Sosh font and must not use others."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"How to enrich the theme","anchor":"How-to-enrich-the-theme"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You cannot derivate the Sosh theme."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"How it looks like","anchor":"How-it-looks-like"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Actions","anchor":"Actions"},{"level":4,"type":"heading","text":"Button","anchor":"Button"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_button_Sosh.png","type":"image"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Content display","anchor":"Content-display"},{"level":4,"type":"heading","text":"Bullet list","anchor":"Bullet-list"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_bullet_list_Sosh.png","type":"image"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Controls","anchor":"Controls"},{"level":4,"type":"heading","text":"Checkboxes","anchor":"Checkboxes"},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"title":"Checkbox","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_checkbox_Sosh.png"}]}]},{"title":"Checkbox item","conte